{
  "description": "TokenOps design tokens: electric lime on ink. The one source for every TokenOps surface. Edit this file, then run `go generate ./internal/tools/gen/designtokens` to write assets/brand/tokens.css and its copies. A colour with `on` and `min` is checked for that contrast ratio (WCAG 2.x) in light and dark by the generator's tests.",
  "prefix": "tok",
